WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,340
Go down to camp and take out those two purses again.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:07,240
Why did the lady think of this again?

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:21,150
I thought that handful of beans was for Shen Yan.

4
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:23,750
Look now, it was clearly aimed at me.

5
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:26,950
Shen Yuan has no grievances or enmities against me. He will give me his son-in-law wherever he goes.

6
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:29,550
There must be someone behind the scenes who is instigating

7
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:31,740
I think things are too simple

8
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:34,740
What form is my cousin’s? Sure enough, it’s the most likely to cause problems.

9
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,940
I have always seen clearly the affairs of others

10
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,940
How come it happened to me, but I didn’t think about it inside?

11
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:44,340
He Qingying is clearly interested in Shen Yan

12
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:49,360
Can't tolerate me He Qingying's friendship with Shen Yan

13
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,360
Does he know it himself?
